  `${measurement.bottomFeet} ft to ${measurement.topFeet} ft over ${measurement.runFeet} ft of ground, `
  + `from ${measurement.resolutionMeters <= 1 ? '1 m lidar' : `${measurement.resolutionMeters} m terrain`} samples.`;
